WEBVTT

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:03.440
He's angry! That man's obviously upset!

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.610
Those full swings are filled with rage!

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:19.620
The challenger grabbed the ropes to avoid a down!

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.750
And that's where the third round ends!

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.220
Takamura-kun, gargle!

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:25.500
No, you need to breathe first!

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.210
Will you all shut up!

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:30.000
Don't worry about me!

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.510
You telling me you have a plan?

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:36.970
Yeah!

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:41.150
It's the fourth round!

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.900
The challenger storms ahead!

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:47.650
<i>Takamura, if you're the same type of boxer as Hawk,</i>

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.660
<i>I'll make this our last round.</i>

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.390
<i>Eagle will be going for broke this round.</i>

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:57.910
<i>Any wild long-range swings will just lead to counters.</i>

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:59.670
<i>The only way to survive this...</i>

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.230
Get in close and infight!

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:04.000
Keep the hits small and to the point!

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:05.680
Shut up!

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:07.630
Don't worry about me!

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:11.240
No huge swings!

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:13.260
You'll fall into the same trap!

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:20.560
There's his counter! The champion remains calm and composed!

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:23.860
<i>He's coming!</i>

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:30.920
Eagle's using him like a punching bag!

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.120
So he's...

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:47.070
What the hell was <i>that</i>  swing?!

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:49.510
You're not a baseball pitcher!

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:56.180
<i>What is he doing? What kind of plan is that?</i>

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:08.280
Why are you swinging at him like that?

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:11.780
You're fighting for the belt! Do it right!

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:16.000
He's displaying all of his bad habits.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.420
Date-san!

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:21.750
If I were his second, I'd be worried to death.

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:27.440
Those wild swings <i>are</i>  risky.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:32.610
However, I really think there's something more to those huge swings.

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:38.430
Me too. I don't think this is how 
Takamura-san will end this fight.

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:51.280
Ah! Takamura lost his balance!

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:57.970
I finally gotcha now!

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:01.000
<i>He didn't lose his balance.</i>

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.330
<i>He's leaning against him on purpose.</i>

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:05.960
<i>Get back here.</i>

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:17.550
The challenger gets in his first big body blow!

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:23.980
<i>Was  </i>that <i>the reason why he was swinging like crazy?</i>

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:32.070
Look at those quick combination punches! What happened to his giant swings?

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:34.380
<i>I can't withstand him this close up.</i>

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.870
<i>I have to get out of here!</i>

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:42.180
Ah! The champion's at the corner!

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.620
He ran all the way to a dead end!

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:47.630
Did he plan for this all along?

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.950
<i>You think you get to hit  </i>me?

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:53.130
<i>Now I'm going to spank your ass!</i>

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:00.170
He has both hands up!

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:03.390
The champion is dumbfounded! There are no means of escape!

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:07.960
<i>The way he used full-swings to get close, and now this.</i>

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:10.650
<i>I've never seen anything like it before.</i>

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:15.150
He can't run left or right! What will the champion do?!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:19.660
Whoa! The challenger comes with both gloves!

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.410
He's going up the middle? That's mighty brave of him.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:29.290
He had him right at the corner, but he'll escape unharmed!

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:32.750
No, he's still one step ahead.

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:42.260
A powerful liver blow from very close range!

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.980
The champion can't escape! He's stuck in the corner!

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:50.630
<i>Now I know for sure.</i>

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:54.810
<i>He doesn't rely entirely on his raw talent and power to throw hits.</i>

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:59.030
<i>That blow could only come from a lower body sculpted by huge amounts of training.</i>

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:03.740
<i>This man is stronger than any opponent I know.</i>

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.840
Get him, Takamura!

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:07.080
Knock him out!

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:10.250
Takamura! Takamura! Takamura!{ad infinitum}

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.130
Oh! He got one!

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.930
<i>I have to get out of here!</i>

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:26.390
The challenger keeps hitting!

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:29.400
He definitely has the momentum!

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:33.900
<i>Jesus!</i>

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.530
A thundering right!

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:40.280
The champion staggers!

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.570
Is this the finishing blow?!

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:50.270
But there's the bell and the end of the fourth round!

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:51.320
So close!

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.060
He almost had him!

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:54.460
Dammit! He was this close!

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.430
You made it out alive.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:07.990
You did good! You're kicking butt!

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:10.940
I never expected that kind of strategy!

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:15.440
I wasn't... even thinking about strategy.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:18.690
But you were a real chess master out there!

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:21.240
Actually...

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:27.450
I just remembered some things.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:32.730
I don't know what you remembered, but at least it settled you down.

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:35.560
Now take that composure to the match.

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:36.800
Quit worrying!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:41.550
I'm not worried about anything. Now get that belt!

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:43.680
Got it!

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:48.750
I was a few seconds away from losing. I got lucky.

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:51.890
It was not luck! You have the skills!

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:54.460
No, I narrowly escaped with my life.

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:56.530
Eagle...

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:58.480
I escaped with my life.

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:01.190
But... I'm okay with that.

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:07.220
<i>Since I got a second chance... I'll make damn good use of it.</i>

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:12.270
It's the fifth round, and both fighters approach the center!

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:15.740
But the champion is weak in his approach!

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.210
He's still feeling the damage from that last bout!

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:26.530
He's charging straight ahead!

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:28.470
Is he ending everything here?!

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:31.850
<i>There's an easy way to tear that guard apart!</i>

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:34.060
<i>Like this!</i>

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:38.730
A huge uppercut! That split the tight guard in two!

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:44.610
Followed by a straight, right up the middle!

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:45.860
Eagle!

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:57.330
He's down! The Golden Eagle's down!

00:07:57.820 --> 00:07:58.820
One!

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.620
Two!

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:02.540
Three!

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.520
Get up, Eagle!

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:04.720
Get up now!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:05.720
Four!{Check , too close to key}

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:07.470
Don't get up! Don't get up! Don't get up!

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:08.470
Five!

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:09.700
The champion's not moving!

00:08:09.700 --> 00:08:10.940
Hell, yeah!

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.430
You got the sweep!

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:15.680
Six!

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:19.070
<i>Sheesh, pipe down.</i>

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:22.150
<i>That punch did get him good, but...</i>

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:23.460
Seven!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.160
<i>Well.</i>

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:31.370
<i>What did you expect?</i>

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:35.910
He's gotten up! The fight's not over!

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:40.930
<i>You're strong. You're very good, Mamoru Takamura!</i>

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:44.170
<i>But, this is what I've been looking for.</i>

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:47.610
<i>All I've known is glory.</i>

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:51.810
<i>But it came with an incredible pressure to keep winning.</i>

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:57.560
<i>I focused on cautiously winning every fight, 
until winning became the only thing.</i>

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:02.210
<i>I never came across a true rival.</i>

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:06.320
<i>I never had a chance to test my strength to the very limits!</i>

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:10.300
<i>I've been waiting patiently for that rival.</i>

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:14.580
<i>And now I've found you!</i>

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:19.330
<i>I've been waiting for you, Mamoru Takamura!</i>

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:26.840
<i>Those eyes.</i>

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:33.140
<i>As long as he has that glint in his eyes, he's not giving up on any fight!</i>

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:35.110
<i>They piss me off!</i>

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:39.600
<i>They're just as supremely aggravating as a certain guy whenever I take him on!</i>

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.300
<i>Those are magnificently textbook one-two punches.</i>

00:09:46.300 --> 00:09:48.360
<i>And they are the most frightening.</i>

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:52.170
Those are the one-two punches that won him both the pro and Olympic titles.

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:56.120
His highly polished textbook punches are Eagle's greatest weapons!

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:59.000
<i>Goddammit, they're so hard to dodge!</i>

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:02.390
<i>He's basically repeating what he practiced endlessly in the ring!</i>

00:10:02.390 --> 00:10:04.340
<i>They're exactly alike!</i>

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:06.800
<i>And it pisses me off to no end!</i>

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:10.880
<i>Now I understand how all your opponents felt.</i>

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:12.980
<i>Those eyes won't quit...</i>

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:15.260
<i>They're infuriatingly persistent!</i>

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:17.290
<i>Yeah, Ippo.</i>

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:19.180
<i>They're just like yours!</i>

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:21.940
Whoa! They hit in sync!

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:35.830
<i>This is bad! He got his eye!</i>

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:39.700
We've got an accident!

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:42.260
There's a huge cut on the challenger's eyelid!

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:46.990
This was a huge chance for him, so that cut's gotta hurt in more ways than one!

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:48.170
Takamura-kun!

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:51.930
So close, yet so far.

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:53.520
He's bleeding a lot!

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:55.140
If he can't see through his left eye...

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:56.930
He's in real trouble!

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:01.910
Keep your pants on! All this does is level the playing field!

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:03.940
He's egging on the champion!

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:07.440
The challenger hasn't lost his swagger!

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:10.190
The blood's going into his left eye.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:12.200
That'll mess up his depth perception.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.220
Miyata-kun?

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:17.060
Don't make that face, or Date-san will know.

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:17.920
But...

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:22.780
Relax. If he really had a detached retina, he wouldn't have gotten this far.

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.620
Yeah, you're right.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.900
But he's still in real trouble.

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:27.960
Focus on the fight!

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:30.310
Pay attention to every move.

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:31.900
O-Okay.

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:40.350
<i>What? Why aren't you coming?</i>

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:44.600
What are you doing?! Go, Eagle!

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:48.900
<i>You trying to recover from that down?</i>

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:50.170
<i>Not on my watch!</i>

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:52.360
<i>You're not resting on account of my bleeding!</i>

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:56.270
Yes! He dodged it!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:58.780
It's not over! His right'll get his eye!

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:01.490
<i>Shit!</i>

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:04.500
<i>I can't make out his right hand!</i>

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.750
<i>He's coming for your cut!</i>

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:08.500
<i>Protect that left eye, Takamura!</i>

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:12.260
Oh! But the champion goes for a body blow!

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:15.510
<i>A body blow?!</i>

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.300
What the...

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:20.010
He aims north! Then south!

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:23.270
<i>Why isn't he going for my eye?</i>

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:27.980
The champion leans in for a close-combat fight!

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:29.260
<i>What?</i>

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:32.030
The challenger is grimacing from all the body blows!

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:36.060
His torso's open because he's desperately covering his face!

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:38.870
That champion's so composed it's scary!

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:42.320
<i>No. That was not a composed decision.</i>

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:44.870
<i>He could have stepped back and done one-two punches.</i>

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:50.220
<i>This infighting is a blessing in disguise for Takamura, who's lost his field of vision.</i>

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:54.880
<i>And above everything else... why isn't he going for the cut?!</i>

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:00.350
The challenger wraps his arms around him!

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:01.890
Is he doing a rare clinch?

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.560
You doing this on purpose?

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:08.020
You think you can ignore my cut and win?

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:10.610
H... He said something to him!

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:12.820
Huh? Takamura-san did?

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.490
Oh! He pushes him back!

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:20.030
<i>You think I'm a chump?!</i>

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:23.880
<i>You take advantage of a handicap!</i>

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:25.750
<i>If you don't, I'll kill you!</i>

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:29.540
Whoa, a giant swing!

00:13:33.070 --> 00:13:35.510
A right body blow! He's not going for the face!

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.260
<i>So... his conscience won't allow it?!</i>

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:40.760
<i>You little punk!</i>

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:43.760
The champion's not going for that eye!

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.560
He's aiming for a clean fight!

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:47.110
What an honorable man!

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:49.770
Now there's a champion I can respect!

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:53.970
What a man. Not many people can do that.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:58.280
That's the end of the fifth round!

00:13:58.280 --> 00:14:01.780
The champion put up a fierce fight after a down!

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:05.860
But we should really be worried about the challenger's wound!

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:08.290
How will it affect the rest of the fight?

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:12.540
Don't worry, I stopped the bleeding.

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:16.780
This stinks.

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:18.550
Why is he infighting?

00:14:18.550 --> 00:14:20.550
Why isn't he going for my cut?

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:24.800
Cool your head! You should be thankful he's not!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.440
Thankful?

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:30.560
I should be "thankful"?!

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:33.950
You should go after his wounded eye!

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:36.500
Quit playing around and extending the match!

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:39.610
Just open that wound up and get a doctor stoppage!

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:42.070
Continuing this slugfest is too risky!

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:45.330
Risky? That I know.

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:48.910
But it means something to me!

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:52.790
Round six!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.340
There's no trace of blood on the challenger!

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:59.090
They've stopped the bleeding!

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:00.660
Good luck, you two!

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:04.090
Takamura, you better match his noble spirit!

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:07.570
<i>"Match his noble spirit"?</i>

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:10.850
<i>You want me to thank him for taking his sweet time?!</i>

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:15.810
The champion rushes in, taking the fight up close!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:18.290
<i>You think you can ignore my cut and win?!</i>

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:20.860
<i>You really piss me off!</i>

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:24.110
The challenger makes a huge swing!

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:25.360
Watch out!

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:31.850
Whoa! They bumped heads!

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:34.010
The champion looks to be hurt!

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:35.520
Next time, I'll take off points!

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:37.140
Didn't mean to do that.

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:39.630
The referee gives him a stern warning!

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:42.630
But that was a purely accidental headbutt!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.890
Oh, he's bleeding!

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:53.020
It's now the champion who's bleeding from his eyelid!

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:55.390
We have another accident on our hands!

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.690
Oh my God!

00:15:57.690 --> 00:16:00.440
<i>Oh? We're bleeding, are we?</i>

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:03.150
That's too bad.

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:09.410
<i>Half of my vision's being covered by a red curtain.</i>

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:12.590
<i>But now we're perfectly even.</i>

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:14.410
<i>Time to fight head to head!</i>

00:16:20.550 --> 00:16:21.960
<i>He's back in the blind spot?!</i>

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:27.720
The champion's favoring that wound
 so much his punches are coming late!

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:31.550
God, Takamura!

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:33.200
He goes to Eagle's blind spot...

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:35.230
...and hits him only in that cut!

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:39.480
<i>Don't think we're on equal footing just because we're both injured!</i>

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:44.080
<i>I'll make that cut twice as large as mine!</i>

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.490
<i>Then I'll put you down covered in blood!</i>

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:47.990
<i>Dammit, I can't see!</i>

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:52.240
A series of left hits! And they keep going for that cut!

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:55.750
The champion's golden locks are turning crimson!

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:57.750
No...

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:02.500
H-He's a monster! Takamura's turned into a monster!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.400
You're fighting dirty! You call yourself a man?!

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:07.740
Try being a real sportsman like the champion!

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:09.670
I've lost all respect for you!

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:12.510
He's being booed by the home crowd.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:17.740
I don't blame them. His is the exact opposite of the sportsmanlike conduct of the champion.

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:19.960
I'm gonna be hearing that from you, too?

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:26.030
People usually cheer when a fighter takes advantage of his opponent's weakness.

00:17:26.030 --> 00:17:28.320
Y... Yes, you're right.

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:34.040
The way Eagle didn't go for the wound gave these fans the wrong idea.

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:39.150
You always take advantage of a disadvantage. That's what a true professional does.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:44.670
That got him!

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.420
The challenger follows up with a right!

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:53.050
<i>I didn't come here to duke it out with you!</i>

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:56.180
<i>You weren't even on my radar to begin with!</i>

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:57.790
<i>I'm only here for...</i>

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:02.190
<i>the belt!</i>

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:04.940
The champion's going down!

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:08.260
No! He's clinching!

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:10.200
He hangs on and avoids a down!

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:12.200
Let go, dammit!

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:14.280
Come on, break it up!

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:18.520
And that ends the sixth round!

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:21.260
The champion literally holds on!

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.960
That asswipe!

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:25.950
How can he be so lucky!

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:28.710
Stop talking! Let me see that cut!

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:35.340
<i>He came in gunning for my wound.</i>

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:36.220
<i>Of course he would.</i>

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:40.100
<i>He's only focused on winning.</i>

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:43.850
<i>He's a purebred boxer who does his job.</i>

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:46.300
I'm taking him down in the next round!

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:48.360
Don't move! I can't stop the bleeding!

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:50.740
<i>But I'm not going to lose!</i>

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:53.860
<i>I'll use my full strength to bring down that man!</i>

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:57.970
And here's the seventh round!

00:18:57.970 --> 00:19:01.410
You don't see their foreheads bleeding! The bleeding has stopped!

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:07.120
They must answer for their amazing support,

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.750
so they both rush to the middle!

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:11.000
<i>We've certainly stopped the bleeding,</i>

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:15.010
<i>but we'll see more bloodshed the second those cuts are hit.</i>

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:19.200
<i>If we see more blood, they might call for a doctor stoppage.</i>

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:21.640
<i>This will be a brief battle!</i>

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:27.900
<i>Now you're going for my cut?</i>

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:30.150
<i>Damn him...</i>

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:32.570
<i>His eyes have changed.</i>

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:34.450
The champion speeds things up!

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:35.570
Is he looking to end it?!

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:40.050
<i>He's aiming for everywhere, not just my cut!</i>

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:42.550
<i>He's going all out to win this.</i>

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:44.570
<i>But not tonight!</i>

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:45.540
<i>I'm the one...</i>

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.290
<i>who's gonna win!</i>

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:49.750
The challenger's responding in kind!

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:52.300
They're really slugging it out in the center!

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:55.460
It's a test of wills, and neither is letting up!

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.400
What a fantastic fight!

00:19:57.400 --> 00:20:00.530
The entire Yokohama Arena is on its feet!
